<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00143/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个钥匙环，当其上被挂有超过两（2）把钥匙或其他带孔物体时，这些钥匙或带孔物体的顺序和正反会在不被注意时发生随机变动。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2019/08/20<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.oCeaN将其上交<br />
<strong>目前状态：</strong>储存于Site-CN-04的低价值物品储存库内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我真的没有强迫症。</em>——Dr.oCeaN<br />
<em>也许可以做成随机摇号器？</em>——Dr.Movian</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00143" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00143" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00143-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocean-funk" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5230323); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5230323&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607653864" alt="oCeaN FunK" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5230323)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocean-funk" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5230323); return false;">oCeaN FunK</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588497730 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">03 May 2020 09:22</span></p>
</div>
